    "This cannot be undone. Deleted learned terms will not be learned again automatically. Existing transcripts are not changed.": { "localizations": { "zh-Hant": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "此操作無法復原。刪除的學習詞彙不會再自動學回，既有逐字稿不受影響。" } } } },
