            "value": "詞彙表裡的詞在會議中出現後，會顯示在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms of Service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服務條款"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That didn't sound like the passage. Read it once more; it doesn't have to be word for word.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聽起來不太像這段話。請再唸一次，不需要一字不差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That was too short to learn your voice. Read the whole passage, a little closer to the microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錄到的聲音太短，還不足以記住你的聲音。請把整段唸完，並靠近麥克風一點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The generated views will need regenerating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生的內容需要重新產生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The meeting ended. Recording stops in %lld seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會議已結束，錄音將在 %lld 秒後停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording is larger than %@ accepts. Use another transcription source.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錄音檔超過 %@ 允許的大小上限。請改用其他轉錄來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording is safe but could not be added to your meetings: %@. mm2t will try again at next launch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "錄音已保存，但無法加入會議清單：%@。mm2t 下次啟動時會再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server requires a token. Enter the server's MM2T_SERVER_TOKEN in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器要求 Token。請在設定填入伺服器的 MM2T_SERVER_TOKEN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The whole browser is recorded. Don't play other audio in it during the meeting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會錄下整個瀏覽器的聲音，會議中請勿在同一瀏覽器播放其他聲音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their voiceprints are removed from this Mac. Past meetings show the speaker's letter again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聲紋會從這台 Mac 刪除，過去的會議會改回顯示代號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-party notices": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第三方授權聲明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Is Me": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This meeting has not been processed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這場會議還沒處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This meeting has too little clear speech from them to update a voiceprint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這場會議中此人的清晰語音不足，無法更新聲紋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This meeting is longer than %@ can process at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這場會議太長，超過 %@ 單次能處理的上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server does not support model listing. Enter a model ID manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此伺服器不支援模型清單，請手動輸入模型 ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To-dos": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待辦事項"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today I am setting up my meeting notes. Whenever we meet in the same room, this is how the app will know which voice is mine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天我要開始用這個工具記錄會議。之後大家在同一間會議室開會的時候，它會靠這段聲音認出哪一位是我。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tomorrow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribing": {
      "localizations": {
